---
const zh = Astro.url.pathname.startsWith('/zh-cn/');
---

<section id="shadow-split-s2" class="s2" data-shadow-s2 aria-label="Shadow split S2">
  <h2>Shadow split · S2</h2>
  <p>
    {
      zh
        ? '设置区：完整 Shadcn Button / Switch Root + Thumb，搭配 Checkbox 与 Badge。检查运动、输入和跨边界组合；仍为 draft。'
        : 'Settings: complete Shadcn Button / Switch Root + Thumb alongside Checkbox and Badge. Inspect motion, input and mixed boundaries; still draft.'
    }
  </p>
  <div class="s2-controls">
    <label
      >Button variant <select data-option="variant"
        >{
          ['default', 'destructive', 'outline', 'secondary', 'ghost', 'link'].map((v) => (
            <option value={v}>{v}</option>
          ))
        }</select
      ></label
    >
    <label
      >Button size <select data-option="size"
        >{['default', 'sm', 'lg', 'icon'].map((v) => <option value={v}>{v}</option>)}</select
      ></label
    >
    <button data-action="scheme"
      >{zh ? '切换整页 light / dark' : 'Toggle document light / dark'}</button
    >
    <button data-action="checked"
      >{zh ? '切换 checked（全部列）' : 'Toggle checked (all columns)'}</button
    >
    <button data-action="rapid">{zh ? '连续反向切换 × 6' : 'Rapid reversal × 6'}</button>
    <button data-action="disabled" aria-pressed="false">disabled</button>
    <button data-action="tone">Badge tone</button>
    <button data-action="slot" aria-pressed="false"
      >{zh ? '替换 Button slot' : 'Replace Button slot'}</button
    >
    <button data-action="move" aria-pressed="false"
      >{zh ? '同步移动设置区' : 'Move settings synchronously'}</button
    >
    <button data-action="disconnect" aria-pressed="false"
      >{zh ? '移除 / 重连设置区' : 'Remove / reconnect settings'}</button
    >
  </div>
  <div class="s2-columns">
    {
      ['light', 'split', 'mixed'].map((profile) => (
        <article data-s2-profile={profile}>
          <h3>
            {profile === 'light'
              ? 'Light DOM'
              : profile === 'split'
                ? 'Shadow split'
                : zh
                  ? '混合组合'
                  : 'Mixed composition'}
          </h3>
          <div data-home>
            <div data-settings>
              <div class="s2-line">
                <>
                  <span data-mount="switch" />
                  <span>{zh ? '自动同步' : 'Auto sync'}</span>
                </>
              </div>
              <div class="s2-line">
                <>
                  <span data-mount="checkbox" />
                  <span>{zh ? '接收通知' : 'Receive notifications'}</span>
                </>
              </div>
              <div class="s2-line">
                <>
                  <span data-mount="button" />
                  <span data-mount="badge" />
                </>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div data-destination />
          <output data-stats aria-live="polite" />
        </article>
      ))
    }
  </div>
  <p>
    {
      zh
        ? '混合列：split Switch + Light Thumb、Light Checkbox + split Indicator、split Button + Light Badge。整页主题开关让所有列共享 document color scheme。'
        : 'Mixed: split Switch + Light Thumb, Light Checkbox + split Indicator, split Button + Light Badge. The document theme control supplies one color scheme to all columns.'
    }
  </p>
  <details>
    <summary>{zh ? '人工验收清单与边界' : 'Manual checklist and boundaries'}</summary>
    <ol>
      <li>
        {
          zh
            ? '鼠标按住 Button / Switch，观察位移、缩放和 focus ring；Tab / Space / Enter 验证真实输入与通知数。'
            : 'Hold Button / Switch with the pointer; inspect translation, scale and focus ring. Use Tab / Space / Enter and check notification counts.'
        }
      </li>
      <li>
        {
          zh
            ? '循环全部 Button variant / size，包括图标；切换主题、disabled 和 checked，快速反向观察 Thumb 不跳帧、不叠加位移。'
            : 'Cycle all Button variants/sizes, including the icon; change theme, disabled and checked. Reverse rapidly and check Thumb continuity without duplicate motion.'
        }
      </li>
      <li>
        {
          zh
            ? '替换 slot、同步移动（generation 不增）、移除重连（generation 增加），确认状态保留、通知不重复。'
            : 'Replace slots, move synchronously (same generation), remove/reconnect (new generation). Check state retention and unduplicated notifications.'
        }
      </li>
    </ol>
    <p>
      {
        zh
          ? '样式来自正式 CLI companion。只撤销网站 base reset 对 split host 的 padding/border 清零；没有页面尺寸补丁。固定边框动画已验证，动态 border-width 仍明确拒绝。slot 仍归 Maker；这不是全浏览器、任意 CSS 或 native/portal 支持声明。'
          : 'Styles come from the real CLI companion. Only the site base reset of split-host padding/border is withdrawn; no page sizing patches. Fixed-border animation is covered; animated border-width is rejected. Slots remain Maker-owned; this is not all-browser, arbitrary-CSS or native/portal support.'
      }
    </p>
  </details>
</section>
<script>
  import { mountShadowSplitS2 } from './shadow-split-s2';
  const initialize = () =>
    document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-shadow-s2]').forEach(mountShadowSplitS2);
  initialize();
  document.addEventListener('astro:page-load', initialize);
</script>
<style is:global>
  .s2 {
    margin-block: 2rem;
    padding: 1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .s2-controls {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    margin-block: 1rem;
  }
  .s2-controls button,
  .s2-controls select {
    font: inherit;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    padding: 0.4rem;
    border: 1px solid currentColor;
    border-radius: 0.3rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    max-width: 100%;
  }
  .s2-controls label {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.3rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .s2-controls button[aria-pressed='true'] {
    background: var(--color-foreground);
    color: var(--color-background);
  }
  .s2-columns {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  .s2-columns article {
    min-width: 0;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding: 0.75rem;
  }
  .s2 [data-settings] {
    font:
      16px/normal Arial,
      sans-serif;
    --pui-canary: #ffd83d;
    --pui-canary-foreground: #172033;
    --pui-sky: #85d7ff;
    --pui-sky-foreground: #172033;
    --pui-coral: #ff937f;
    --pui-coral-foreground: #172033;
  }
  .s2-line {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-block: 1rem;
  }
  .s2 [data-mount] {
    display: block;
  }
  .s2 [data-stats] {
    display: block;
    white-space: pre-line;
    font: 12px/1.6 monospace;
    margin-block: 1rem;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  .s2 .s2-sr {
    position: absolute;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1px;
    padding: 0;
    margin: -1px;
    overflow: hidden;
    clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);
    white-space: nowrap;
    border: 0;
  }
  @layer base {
    .s2 [data-s2-split] {
      padding: revert-layer;
      border: revert-layer;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .s2-columns {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
